c 5-literal XOR: exercises the --cutnum cutting-point aux-var machinery in ANF -> CNF.
c With --cutnum 5 the entire XOR fits in one chunk (5 vars, 2^(5-1)=16 clauses).
c With --cutnum 3 the XOR is split into two chunks joined by 1 auxiliary variable
c (6 vars, fewer total clauses because each smaller chunk has 2^(3-1)=4 combinations).
x0 + x1 + x2 + x3 + x4
